@startuml

!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/class-diagram-style.iuml

title Impact Analysis: Change Propagation Through Used-By

rectangle "Web Controller" as WC $theme_surface
rectangle "Mobile Controller" as MC $theme_surface
rectangle "API Gateway" as AG $theme_surface
rectangle "**Order Service**" as OS $fill_ok
rectangle "**Inventory Service**" as IS $fill_ok
rectangle "  Payment Gateway  " as PG $fill_primary

WC -down-> OS : <<uses>>
MC -down-> OS : <<uses>>
AG -down-> OS : <<uses>>
OS -down-> IS : <<uses>>
OS -down-> PG : <<uses>>

note as CHANGE $fill_invalid
  **Proposed Change:**
  Modify Payment Gateway
  interface
end note

CHANGE .right. PG

note right of OS $fill_caution
  **Direct Impact**
  Order Service directly
  uses Payment Gateway
  → must be reviewed
end note

note right of WC $fill_caution
  **Transitive Impact**
  All three controllers
  use Order Service
  → potentially affected
end note

note as SCOPE $fill_dynamic
  **Impact Scope = 4 modules**
  Direct: Order Service
  Transitive: Web Controller,
  Mobile Controller, API Gateway
end note
@enduml
